      "parameters": {
        "content": "## G2-2 \u2014 Weekly Salesforce-admin hiring list in Google Sheets\n\n**Who:** outbound / RevOps / Clay ops watching startup boards for Salesforce Administrator roles.\n\n**Flow:** Schedule \u2192 Buyer inputs \u2192 Apify `publicrecords/ashby-jobs-scraper` \u2192 Code filter (Salesforce admin / RevOps-adjacent) \u2192 Google Sheets Append.\n\n**Setup:** 1) Header Auth `Authorization: Bearer <APIFY_TOKEN>` (publisher). 2) Google Sheets OAuth. 3) Edit companies / since / maxResults / sheetDocumentId / sheetName. 4) Full ~200 slug list: `ashby-board-slugs.json`.\n\n**Cost:** actor-start $0.005 + $0.0009/job; keep maxResults\u226440 and maxTotalChargeUsd\u22640.5 for demos.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
